reVRPanel_Landscape.png", "id": "871500632313941", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295279_871500635647274_5005781711240289746_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ker-W1dSFFMQ7kNvwGRavIc&_nc_oc=Adk9ygtRKog5GDA7LEIi_CJP-QDT_LDRW1mak6I6v_TaBEh_4JgRbmfDqegqrFhhaJM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxfFWFKqvABFEmv-0ShkPTHvoYc9Hx6dp3CXhHgIlSdhg&oe=69AAC69D"}, "display_name": "Solitaire - VR Panel", "keywords": ["card", "2D", "relaxed", "solo", "klondike"], "long_description": "Solitaire \u2013 VR Panel is a classic card game built for multitasking on Meta Quest.\n\n# **Play familiar Solitaire in a lightweight VR panel**\nThe game can stay open alongside other apps and experiences. Whether you are taking a break, filling a few spare minutes, or just want something relaxing running in the background.\n\n# **Traditional Solitaire, in VR!**\nThe game includes all the features you would expect from a modern Solitaire experience, including multiple scoring modes, draw 1 or draw 3 options, daily games, hints, undo, and auto-complete for completed wins. Customize your experience with different backgrounds and settings to match how you like to play.\n\n# **Designed specifically as a VR Panel App**\nSolitaire \u2013 VR Panel lets you enjoy a timeless card game without pulling you away from whatever else you are doing in Quest. Play at your own pace, your own way, while keeping other content within reach!", "short_description": "Solitaire - VR Panel brings classic Solitaire to Meta Quest in a lightweight panel you can play alongside anything else. Enjoy familiar options like multiple scoring modes, draw 1 or 3, daily games, customizable backgrounds, and more. Perfect for a quick round while multitasking in VR!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://petricoregames.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://petricoregames.com/tos/", "publisher_name": "Petricore"